{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-metrics-collection","title":"自定义指标采集与上报链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/custom-metrics-collection","wordCount":644,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义指标采集与上报链路\">自定义指标采集与上报链路</h1><p>Core Web Vitals 是通用体验指标，但每个产品都有自己定义&quot;快&quot;的方式。电商平台关心&quot;商品图片可交互时间&quot;，SaaS 应用关心&quot;仪表盘数据首次可见&quot;，视频站关心&quot;首帧播放延迟&quot;。User Timing API 和 Long Animation Frames 让你为这些业务关键路径定义精确的自定义指标，而上报链路的设计决定了数据能否完整、低损、不扰用户地传回后端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自定义指标体系围绕三个层次展开：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[自定义性能指标] --&gt; B[User Timing API&lt;br/&gt;mark + measure]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Element Timing API&lt;br/&gt;关键元素渲染时间]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Server Timing&lt;br/&gt;后端耗时透传]&#10;    B --&gt; E[业务关键路径计时]&#10;    C --&gt; F[特定 UI 元素可见时间]&#10;    D --&gt; G[前后端全链路耗时]&#10;    E --&gt; H[上报链路]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[sendBeacon / fetch+keepalive]&#10;    H --&gt; J[批量 + 压缩 + 采样]\">graph TD\n    A[自定义性能指标] --&gt; B[User Timing API&lt;br/&gt;mark + measure]\n    A --&gt; C[Element Timing API&lt;br/&gt;关键元素渲染时间]\n    A --&gt; D[Server Timing&lt;br/&gt;后端耗时透传]\n    B --&gt; E[业务关键路径计时]\n    C --&gt; F[特定 UI 元素可见时间]\n    D --&gt; G[前后端全链路耗时]\n    E --&gt; H[上报链路]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[sendBeacon / fetch+keepalive]\n    H --&gt; J[批量 + 压缩 + 采样]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>User Timing</td>\n<td>任意代码路径耗时</td>\n<td><code>performance.mark()</code> / <code>measure()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Element Timing</td>\n<td>特定 DOM 元素渲染时间</td>\n<td><code>elementtiming</code> 属性 + Observer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Timing</td>\n<td>后端各阶段耗时（附在 HTTP 头）</td>\n<td><code>Server-Timing</code> response header</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Custom PerformanceEntry</td>\n<td>完全自定义的性能事件</td>\n<td><code>performance.measure()</code> with detail</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"user-timing-高级用法\">User Timing 高级用法</h2><p>超越简单的 mark/measure，User Timing Level 3 支持在 <code>measure()</code> 中附加结构化 <code>detail</code> 数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 带结构化上下文的业务指标&#10;performance.mark(&#39;search-start&#39;, {&#10;  detail: { query: userQuery, resultCount: 0 },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const results = await fetchSearchResults(userQuery);&#10;&#10;performance.mark(&#39;search-end&#39;, {&#10;  detail: { query: userQuery, resultCount: results.length },&#10;});&#10;&#10;performance.measure(&#39;search-latency&#39;, {&#10;  start: &#39;search-start&#39;,&#10;  end: &#39;search-end&#39;,&#10;  detail: {&#10;    query: userQuery,&#10;    resultCount: results.length,&#10;    source: &#39;elasticsearch&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 带结构化上下文的业务指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail: { query: userQuery, resultCount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchSearchResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userQuery);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail: { query: userQuery, resultCount: results.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-latency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  start: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  end: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: userQuery,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resultCount: results.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    source: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'elasticsearch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结合 PerformanceObserver 自动采集：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    if (entry.name.startsWith(&#39;search-&#39;) || entry.name.startsWith(&#39;checkout-&#39;)) {&#10;      reportCustomMetric({&#10;        name: entry.name,&#10;        duration: entry.duration,&#10;        detail: (entry as any).detail,&#10;        timestamp: entry.startTime,&#10;      });&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;measure&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry.name.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.name.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      reportCustomMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: entry.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        duration: entry.duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        detail: (entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).detail,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        timestamp: entry.startTime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'measure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"element-timing-精确追踪\">Element Timing 精确追踪</h2><p>Element Timing API 让你监测特定 DOM 元素何时渲染到屏幕上——比 LCP 更精确，因为你可以指定具体关心的元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 标记需要追踪渲染时间的元素 --&gt;&#10;&lt;img src=&quot;hero.avif&quot; elementtiming=&quot;hero-image&quot; alt=&quot;首屏主图&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;div elementtiming=&quot;price-display&quot;&gt;¥299.00&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;canvas elementtiming=&quot;chart-render&quot; id=&quot;dashboard-chart&quot;&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 标记需要追踪渲染时间的元素 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hero.avif\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> elementtiming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hero-image\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> alt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"首屏主图\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> elementtiming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price-display\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>¥299.00&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">canvas</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> elementtiming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chart-render\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dashboard-chart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">canvas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    // entry.identifier = elementtiming 属性值&#10;    // entry.renderTime = 元素首次渲染时间&#10;    // entry.loadTime = 资源加载完成时间（图片）&#10;    reportCustomMetric({&#10;      name: `element-${entry.identifier}`,&#10;      value: entry.renderTime || entry.loadTime,&#10;      element: entry.identifier,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;element&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1