WebSocket</td>\n<td>实时双向</td>\n<td>页面卸载时不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>User Timing API 支持带结构化 detail 的自定义业务指标</li>\n<li>Element Timing 精确追踪指定 DOM 元素的渲染时间</li>\n<li>Server Timing 将后端耗时透传给前端，实现全链路归因</li>\n<li>上报链路以 sendBeacon 为首选，配合批量缓冲和 visibilitychange 兜底</li>\n<li>采样策略：全量上报关键指标值，采样上报详细归因和上下文信息</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"performance-observer-api\">PerformanceObserver API 实战</a>——自定义指标采集的底层 Observer 接口</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-error-handling/practice/error-reporting\">前端错误处理 — 错误上报</a>——上报链路设计在错误监控场景的复用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义指标采集与上报链路","id":"自定义指标采集与上报链路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"User Timing 高级用法","id":"user-timing-高级用法"},{"level":2,"text":"Element Timing 精确追踪","id":"element-timing-精确追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"Server Timing 全链路透传","id":"server-timing-全链路透传"},{"level":2,"text":"上报链路架构设计","id":"上报链路架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"web-vitals 库与归因采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/web-vitals-library"},"next":{"title":"CrUX 真实用户数据解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/crux-field-data"}}